# Conformance probe pack for `rest` as the last line of one item kind of an
# outer `rest` group (spec 0.21 rulings 10 and 27), most significant bit
# first. Public. No message kinds.
#
#   items       items to the end of the message; each selects a kind by its
#               first byte
#     kind a    when 8 1, requires qty: qty in 8 bits
#     kind b    when 8 2: subs to the end of the message (val in 8 bits
#               each). Only the last item may be of kind b.
format     conformance-extents-outerkind
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.items rest
  kind  a
  when  8  1
  requires probe.qty
  field  probe.qty  8  uint
  kind  b
  when  8  2
  group  probe.subs rest
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
